{"instance":"main","template":"problem.show","status":200,"locale":"zh-CN","data":{"problem":{"pid":"P4351","type":"P","name":"[CERC2015] Frightful Formula","difficulty":7,"fullScore":100,"tags":[5,32,252,335,502],"totalSubmit":1050,"totalAccepted":555,"flag":5,"provider":{"uid":53374,"avatar":"https:\/\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\/upload\/usericon\/53374.png","name":"SuperJvRuo","slogan":"","badge":null,"isAdmin":false,"isBanned":false,"color":"Gray","ccfLevel":6,"xcpcLevel":0,"background":""},"contenu":{"name":"[CERC2015] Frightful Formula","background":null,"description":"\u5b9a\u4e49\u4e00\u4e2a\u77e9\u9635 $F$\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d\u7b2c\u4e00\u884c\u548c\u7b2c\u4e00\u5217\u662f\u7ed9\u5b9a\u7684\uff0c\u8ba1\u7b97\u77e9\u9635\u65b9\u6cd5\u5982\u4e0b\uff1a\n\n- \u77e9\u9635\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u5217\u662f\u5e8f\u5217  $l$\uff1a\n\n$$F_{k,1}=l _ k$$\n\n- \u77e9\u9635\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u884c\u662f\u5e8f\u5217  $t$\uff1a\n\n$$F_{1,k}=t _ k$$\n\n- \u5176\u4ed6\u5143\u7d20\u4f7f\u7528\u7ed9\u5b9a\u7684\u9012\u5f52\u516c\u5f0f\u8fdb\u884c\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n\n$$\nF_{i,j}=a \\times F_{i,j-1}+b \\times F_{i-1,j}+c\n$$\n\n\u73b0\u5728\u8981\u6c42\u627e\u6c42\u51fa $F_{n,n}$ \u6a21 $10^6+3$ \u7684\u503c\u3002","formatI":"\u7b2c\u4e00\u884c\u5305\u542b\u56db\u4e2a\u6574\u6570 $n$\uff0c$a$\uff0c$b$ \u548c $c(2 \\le n \\le 2 \\times 10^5,0 \\le a,b$\uff0c$c \\le 10^6)$ \u77e9\u9635\u7684\u5927\u5c0f\u548c\u9012\u5f52\u53c2\u6570\uff0c\u5982\u95ee\u9898\u63cf\u8ff0\u4e2d\u6240\u8ff0\u3002\n\n\u4e0b\u9762\u4e24\u884c\u5206\u522b\u5305\u542b\u6574\u6570 $l_1, \\cdots ,l_n$ \u548c $t_1, \\cdots ,t_n(l_1=t_1,0 \\le l_k,t_k \\le 10^6)$\u3002","formatO":"\u8f93\u51fa\u4e00\u4e2a\u6574\u6570\u7684\u503c\u5373 $F_{n,n}$ \u6a21 $10^6+3$\u3002\n\n\u611f\u8c22 @ \u5b88\u671b\u63d0\u4f9b\u7684\u7ffb\u8bd1\u3002","hint":null,"locale":"zh-CN"},"content":{"name":"[CERC2015] Frightful Formula","background":"","description":"A frightful matrix is a square matrix of order n where the \ufb01rst row and the \ufb01rst column are explicitly speci\ufb01ed, while the other elements are calculated using a frightful formula which is, actually, a simple recursive rule. \n\nGiven two integer sequences l and t,both of size n,as well as integer parameters a,b and c,the frightful matrix F is de\ufb01ned as follows:\n\n* The \ufb01rst column of the matrix is the sequence l: \n\n$$F[k, 1] = lk$$ \n\n* The \ufb01rst row of the matrix is the sequence t: \n\n$$F[1, k] = tk$$ \n\n* Other elements are calculated using a recursive formula: \n\n$$F[i,j]=a*F[i,j-1]+b*F[i-1,j]+c$$\n\nGiven a frightful matrix, \ufb01nd the value of the element $F[n,n]$ modulo $10^6 +3$.","formatI":"The \ufb01rst line contains four integers n, a, b and c (2\u2264n\u2264200000, 0\u2264 a, b, c\u2264$10^6$) \u2013 the size of the matrix and the recursion parameters, as described in the problem statement. \n\nThe two following lines contain integers l1,...,ln and t1,...,tn, respectively (l1 = t1, 0\u2264lk, tk \u2264106). ","formatO":"Output a single integer \u2013 the value of $F[n,n]$ modulo $10^6 +3$.","hint":"Central Europe Regional Contest 2015 Problem F","locale":"en"},"attachments":[],"showScore":true,"acceptSolution":true,"acceptLanguages":[5,1,2,28,3,4,11,12,27,34,7,25,8,33,15,14,19,30,31,32,21,22,17,9,16,13,23],"samples":[["3 0 0 0 \n0 0 2 \n0 3 0","0"],["4 3 5 2 \n7 1 4 3 \n7 4 4 8","41817"]],"limits":{"time":[10000,10000,10000,10000,10000],"memory":[512000,512000,512000,512000,512000]}},"translations":{"en":{"name":"[CERC2015] Frightful Formula","background":"","description":"A frightful matrix is a square matrix of order n where the \ufb01rst row and the \ufb01rst column are explicitly speci\ufb01ed, while the other elements are calculated using a frightful formula which is, actually, a simple recursive rule. \n\nGiven two integer sequences l and t,both of size n,as well as integer parameters a,b and c,the frightful matrix F is de\ufb01ned as follows:\n\n* The \ufb01rst column of the matrix is the sequence l: \n\n$$F[k, 1] = lk$$ \n\n* The \ufb01rst row of the matrix is the sequence t: \n\n$$F[1, k] = tk$$ \n\n* Other elements are calculated using a recursive formula: \n\n$$F[i,j]=a*F[i,j-1]+b*F[i-1,j]+c$$\n\nGiven a frightful matrix, \ufb01nd the value of the element $F[n,n]$ modulo $10^6 +3$.","formatI":"The \ufb01rst line contains four integers n, a, b and c (2\u2264n\u2264200000, 0\u2264 a, b, c\u2264$10^6$) \u2013 the size of the matrix and the recursion parameters, as described in the problem statement. \n\nThe two following lines contain integers l1,...,ln and t1,...,tn, respectively (l1 = t1, 0\u2264lk, tk \u2264106). ","formatO":"Output a single integer \u2013 the value of $F[n,n]$ modulo $10^6 +3$.","hint":"Central Europe Regional Contest 2015 Problem F","locale":"en"},"zh-CN":{"name":"[CERC2015] Frightful Formula","background":null,"description":"\u5b9a\u4e49\u4e00\u4e2a\u77e9\u9635 $F$\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d\u7b2c\u4e00\u884c\u548c\u7b2c\u4e00\u5217\u662f\u7ed9\u5b9a\u7684\uff0c\u8ba1\u7b97\u77e9\u9635\u65b9\u6cd5\u5982\u4e0b\uff1a\n\n- \u77e9\u9635\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u5217\u662f\u5e8f\u5217  $l$\uff1a\n\n$$F_{k,1}=l _ k$$\n\n- \u77e9\u9635\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u884c\u662f\u5e8f\u5217  $t$\uff1a\n\n$$F_{1,k}=t _ k$$\n\n- \u5176\u4ed6\u5143\u7d20\u4f7f\u7528\u7ed9\u5b9a\u7684\u9012\u5f52\u516c\u5f0f\u8fdb\u884c\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n\n$$\nF_{i,j}=a \\times F_{i,j-1}+b \\times F_{i-1,j}+c\n$$\n\n\u73b0\u5728\u8981\u6c42\u627e\u6c42\u51fa $F_{n,n}$ \u6a21 $10^6+3$ \u7684\u503c\u3002","formatI":"\u7b2c\u4e00\u884c\u5305\u542b\u56db\u4e2a\u6574\u6570 $n$\uff0c$a$\uff0c$b$ \u548c $c(2 \\le n \\le 2 \\times 10^5,0 \\le a,b$\uff0c$c \\le 10^6)$ \u77e9\u9635\u7684\u5927\u5c0f\u548c\u9012\u5f52\u53c2\u6570\uff0c\u5982\u95ee\u9898\u63cf\u8ff0\u4e2d\u6240\u8ff0\u3002\n\n\u4e0b\u9762\u4e24\u884c\u5206\u522b\u5305\u542b\u6574\u6570 $l_1, \\cdots ,l_n$ \u548c $t_1, \\cdots ,t_n(l_1=t_1,0 \\le l_k,t_k \\le 10^6)$\u3002","formatO":"\u8f93\u51fa\u4e00\u4e2a\u6574\u6570\u7684\u503c